{"id":3653,"date":"2017-05-02T17:28:15","date_gmt":"2017-05-02T21:28:15","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?p=3653"},"modified":"2017-05-02T17:28:15","modified_gmt":"2017-05-02T21:28:15","slug":"first-day-in-michigan-proud-lake-recreation-area","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/2017\/05\/02\/first-day-in-michigan-proud-lake-recreation-area\/","title":{"rendered":"First Day in Michigan @ Proud Lake Recreation Area"},"content":{"rendered":"<figure id=\"attachment_3654\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-3654\" style=\"width: 350px\" class=\"wp-caption alignright\"><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-04-06-19.13.10.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-3654\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-04-06-19.13.10-1024x576.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"350\" height=\"197\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-04-06-19.13.10-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-04-06-19.13.10-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-04-06-19.13.10-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-04-06-19.13.10.jpg 760w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 350px) 100vw, 350px\" \/><\/a><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-3654\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Our &#8220;home&#8221; parked in front of the bunkhouse<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p>We left Mount Gilead on Monday morning May 1st. \u00a0We had parked in the driveway for the month of April, were able to see our doctors, get our taxes done, attend worship at our church, and have plenty of time to visit with family and good friends.<\/p>\n<p>While we were &#8220;home&#8221;, we took advantage of the time available to us to sell a lot of what we had left behind when we started this new full-time RV&#8217;ing lifestyle last September.<\/p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_3667\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-3667\" style=\"width: 150px\" class=\"wp-caption alignright\"><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2012-09-02-18.59.52.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-thumbnail wp-image-3667\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2012-09-02-18.59.52-150x150.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" \/><\/a><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-3667\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Sara &amp; Stu<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p>Since our daughter and son-in-law were renting the house from us in our absence, it made our departure much easier as we had literally left nearly everything behind.<\/p>\n<p>But now that we have confirmed that this full-time thing is for us (at least for the next few years), we want to sell the house so that we can be totally debt-free. \u00a0Selling the house will free up money that will allow us to pay off what little debt we have. \u00a0Craigslist and Facebook allowed us to sell thousands of dollars worth of household and yard\/garden tools &amp; equipment in very short order. \u00a0I sold Dewalt drills, a Mastertow Tow Dolly, Agrifab lawn sweeper, Cushman golf cart, and a whole lot more. \u00a0It was amazing how quickly things sold.<\/p>\n<p>We&#8217;re not worried about where we might live when the time comes to hang up our keys to the coach. \u00a0We still own four rental units in Mount Gilead with great renters in each, but if push comes to shove we could ask any of the tenants to leave and we could take their place.<\/p>\n<p>Another alternative is for us to take advantage of the life-time RV Lot lease program at any of the Escapee&#8217;s Co-Op Parks around the south, southwest, and northwest parts of the country. \u00a0Depending on the park and the amenities, lifetime leases are available for anywhere from about $7000 to $25,000 (one time payment). \u00a0Once the lease is paid, the only on-going costs are electricity and an annual Operating &amp; Maintenance fee that usually runs $600-$1200 yearly. \u00a0And the really great part is that when we are &#8220;done&#8221; with the lot, whether it be 1 year later or 20 years down the road, we turn it back over to the Co-Op and get 100% of our lease money invested back!<\/p>\n<p>But that&#8217;s on down the road a bit. \u00a0Right now our plan now is to spend a week here in Southeast Michigan where we can visit friends and family that we&#8217;ve known for 40 years or more and then we&#8217;ll move on up the road at the end of the week to the Grand Rapids and Holland, Michigan areas to see more &#8220;old&#8221; friends and then up to Baldwin, Michigan (near Ludington) to start our summer workamping job by May 15th.<\/p>\n<p>We are camped at <a href=\"http:\/\/www.michigan.org\/property\/proud-lake-recreation-area\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Proud Lake Recreation Area<\/a> just off Wixom Road in Commerce Twp, MI. \u00a0This is just north of I-96 about 5 miles. \u00a0There&#8217;s about 4700 acres of wooded wilderness here with miles of trails and the campground offers 130 (electric) sites along with a small beach and boat launch. \u00a0The shower house was built new in 2016 and offers very attractive and comfortable private bath and shower rooms. \u00a0Here&#8217;s a slide show of a few pictures of the campground facilities.<\/p>\n<div id='gallery-1' class='gallery galleryid-3653 gallery-columns-3 gallery-size-large'><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-02-08.36.07.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"685\" height=\"385\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-02-08.36.07-1024x576.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large\" alt=\"\" aria-describedby=\"gallery-1-3657\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-02-08.36.07-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-02-08.36.07-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-02-08.36.07-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-02-08.36.07.jpg 760w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 685px) 100vw, 685px\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<figcaption class='wp-caption-text gallery-caption' id='gallery-1-3657'>\n\t\t\t\tWhat kind of fruit tree is this?\n\t\t\t\t<\/figcaption><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-01-19.22.08.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"685\" height=\"385\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-01-19.22.08-1024x576.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large\" alt=\"\" aria-describedby=\"gallery-1-3658\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-01-19.22.08-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-01-19.22.08-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-01-19.22.08-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-01-19.22.08.jpg 760w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 685px) 100vw, 685px\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<figcaption class='wp-caption-text gallery-caption' id='gallery-1-3658'>\n\t\t\t\tLooking down one of the rows of camp sites\n\t\t\t\t<\/figcaption><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-01-19.15.36.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"685\" height=\"385\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-01-19.15.36-1024x576.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large\" alt=\"\" aria-describedby=\"gallery-1-3659\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-01-19.15.36-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-01-19.15.36-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-01-19.15.36-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-01-19.15.36.jpg 760w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 685px) 100vw, 685px\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<figcaption class='wp-caption-text gallery-caption' id='gallery-1-3659'>\n\t\t\t\tOutside view of the new shower house\n\t\t\t\t<\/figcaption><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-01-19.15.24.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"685\" height=\"385\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-01-19.15.24-1024x576.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large\" alt=\"\" aria-describedby=\"gallery-1-3660\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-01-19.15.24-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-01-19.15.24-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-01-19.15.24-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-01-19.15.24.jpg 760w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 685px) 100vw, 685px\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<figcaption class='wp-caption-text gallery-caption' id='gallery-1-3660'>\n\t\t\t\tLooking over the hill to Proud Lake from the Shower House\n\t\t\t\t<\/figcaption><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-01-19.11.52.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"685\" height=\"385\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-01-19.11.52-1024x576.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large\" alt=\"\" aria-describedby=\"gallery-1-3661\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-01-19.11.52-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-01-19.11.52-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-01-19.11.52-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-01-19.11.52.jpg 760w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 685px) 100vw, 685px\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<figcaption class='wp-caption-text gallery-caption' id='gallery-1-3661'>\n\t\t\t\tGuess who?  (It was cold this day!)\n\t\t\t\t<\/figcaption><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-01-19.11.02.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"685\" height=\"385\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-01-19.11.02-1024x576.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large\" alt=\"\" aria-describedby=\"gallery-1-3662\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-01-19.11.02-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-01-19.11.02-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-01-19.11.02-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-01-19.11.02.jpg 760w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 685px) 100vw, 685px\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<figcaption class='wp-caption-text gallery-caption' id='gallery-1-3662'>\n\t\t\t\tDown the stairs to the lake\n\t\t\t\t<\/figcaption><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-01-19.04.55.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"685\" height=\"385\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-01-19.04.55-1024x576.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large\" alt=\"\" aria-describedby=\"gallery-1-3663\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-01-19.04.55-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-01-19.04.55-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-01-19.04.55-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-01-19.04.55.jpg 760w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 685px) 100vw, 685px\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<figcaption class='wp-caption-text gallery-caption' id='gallery-1-3663'>\n\t\t\t\tOur camp site in the woods\n\t\t\t\t<\/figcaption><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-01-15.47.36.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"685\" height=\"385\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-01-15.47.36-1024x576.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large\" alt=\"\" aria-describedby=\"gallery-1-3664\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-01-15.47.36-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-01-15.47.36-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-01-15.47.36-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-01-15.47.36.jpg 760w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 685px) 100vw, 685px\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<figcaption class='wp-caption-text gallery-caption' id='gallery-1-3664'>\n\t\t\t\tLooking out our front window to the rest of the campground\n\t\t\t\t<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\n<p>Today (Tuesday May 2nd) we spent a few hours (and lunch at a great Mexican Restaurant) with Jeff &amp; Sandy (Overmeyer) Houghton. \u00a0Sandy is the cute little girl with blond curls on the left in the first row (our 2nd grade class picture)<\/p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_3665\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-3665\" style=\"width: 337px\" class=\"wp-caption alignright\"><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2nd-Grade-Fosmoe.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\" wp-image-3665\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2nd-Grade-Fosmoe-300x225.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"337\" height=\"253\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2nd-Grade-Fosmoe-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2nd-Grade-Fosmoe-768x576.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2nd-Grade-Fosmoe-1024x768.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2nd-Grade-Fosmoe.jpg 720w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 337px) 100vw, 337px\" \/><\/a><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-3665\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Mrs. Fosmoe&#8217;s 2nd grade class, Bulman Elementary<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p>Jeff, Sandy, Kathy, and I all were in High School together and graduated in 1972.<\/p>\n<p>We&#8217;ve got more planned for the rest of the week and we&#8217;ll fill that in as we go along.<\/p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_3668\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-3668\" style=\"width: 300px\" class=\"wp-caption alignleft\"><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/IMG952082.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-medium wp-image-3668\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/IMG952082-300x225.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"225\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/IMG952082-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/IMG952082-768x576.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/IMG952082-1024x768.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/IMG952082.jpg 720w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" \/><\/a><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-3668\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Kathy, Herb, Sandy, &amp; Jeff<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>We left Mount Gilead on Monday morning May 1st. \u00a0We had parked in the driveway for the month of April, were able to see our doctors, get our taxes done, attend worship at our church, and have plenty of time to visit with family and good friends. While we were &#8220;home&#8221;, we took advantage of &hellip; <a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/2017\/05\/02\/first-day-in-michigan-proud-lake-recreation-area\/\" class=\"more-link\">Continue reading <span class=\"screen-reader-text\">First Day in Michigan @ Proud Lake Recreation Area<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[13403,677,554707329],"tags":[554707346,6376,554707347,11110,554707348,130],"class_list":["post-3653","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","hentry","category-camping","category-friends","category-traveling","tag-camp","tag-class","tag-elementary","tag-michigan","tag-redford","tag-school"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/3653","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=3653"}],"version-history":[{"count":6,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/3653\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":3671,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/3653\/revisions\/3671"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=3653"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/categories?post=3653"},{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=3653"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}